    stage3_current_source_hir_rss_termination_2026_08_14, 0, "After the HIR contract-model diagnostic cleared, two current-source pure-Simple Stage 3 retries grew without a compiler diagnostic or candidate; the final bounded cycle was terminated by signal 15 after 12m52s at 24,839,624 KiB maximum RSS."
    stage3_hir_contract_model_partial_integration_2026_08_14, 0, "Current-source pure-Simple Stage 3 parsed all 616 sources but failed closed in HIR lowering because verification MIR/backend consumers referenced HirContractClauseKind and HirContractOutcome while the canonical HIR contract model and HirFunction.verification_contract field were absent."
    stage3_current_acceptance_false_closure_2026_08_14, 0, "Historical LIM-010 constructor stripping was incorrectly used to close current Stage 3 despite deferred integration criteria; tracked Stage 1/2/3 binaries are byte-identical, lack a matching canonical Stage 3 provenance receipt, and current native-build reaches separate tagged-value/list and direct-call-zero crashes."
    interp_u64_high_bit_option_unwrap_corruption, 0,
    llm-caret-tui-extern-gaps, 0, "TTY detection is already routed through std.tui.terminal and rt_terminal_is_tty; the remaining reproducible gap is terminal-owner wiring for the existing rt_atexit_install and rt_signal_install/rt_signal_check runtime latches, so raw-mode recovery and SIGWINCH redraw cannot be guaranteed"
    itf-color-nontty-gap, 0, "The live owner moved to app.devhub.output; should_use_color handles NO_COLOR and ITF_FORCE_COLOR but then returns true unconditionally because the terminal facade exposes only stdin TTY state and the output policy never checks stdout"
    wiki-confluence-mock-file-io, 0,
    json-parser-nested-object-nil, 0,
    match_bare_ident_const_irrefutable, 0,
    itf-config-colon-value-split, 0,
    text-split-limit-ignored, 0, "Both live Rust interpreter string dispatch implementations consume only the separator, while native MIR admits split only when args.len() == 1; the two-argument language surface therefore ignores or rejects the limit depending on execution mode"
