    compiled_checker_expression_primary_gaps_2026_08_03, 0, "Fixed ten frozen expression roots in shared parser owners; nine whole files pass and the unsafe row advances to a separately tracked asm-volatile grammar gap"
    compiled_checker_asm_volatile_indent_gap_2026_08_03, 0, "Rerouted after source-000201 cleared its original unsafe-block diagnostic and reached canonical asm volatile indented-block syntax"
    stage4_parser_expr_parse_int_text_facade_ambiguity_2026_08_03, 0, Wildcard ParserImport declarations use an empty item list and were invisible to explicit facade export-origin precedence; parser_expr therefore fell through to ambiguous same-package sibling inference despite its parser_primary glob route
    stage4_env_paths_llvm_undeclared_variables_2026_08_03, 0, "PARTIAL: binding the namespace to the retained ModuleSurface owner fixes the focused synthetic HIR-to-MIR cases but is insufficient on the real Stage4 entry-closure; cycle 3 still lowers variables as an undeclared LLVM global"
    native_project_src_std_platform_alias_owner_loss_2026_08_03, 0, "Rust native-project loses aliased normalize_path and is_absolute_path owners through the legacy src.std.platform shim and its transitive platform/path re-export chain when duplicate family providers prevent unique fallback"
    llvm_bool_bitcast_to_ptr_invalid_ir_2026_08_03, 0, "FIXED by /root/llvm_cast_hardening for the x86 Stage4 root lane: value_as_type emits target-native i1-to-ptr and null-comparison ptr-to-i1 conversions and fails closed for unsupported coercions; the env paths missing-store/value-loss defect remains separate"
    llvm_constants_lost_ret_zero_2026_08_01, 0, "Flat-bootstrap native execution retains generated allocas and read-side loads but drops defining MIR instructions and their required slot stores"
    bootstrap_seed_fingerprint_per_file_process_storm_2026_08_03, 0, "Stage 4 seed authority fingerprints 43,191 files with one hash and one parser process per file, spending 181 seconds before compilation"
    stage4_cli_named_type_extraction_loss_2026_08_03, 0, "Admitted pure-Simple Stage 3 reaches Phase 3 then misclassifies GlobalFlags.mem_infra_requested from Array as Named"
    stage4_devhub_wiki_function_local_process_import_2026_08_03, 0, "Function-local use statements are bootstrap parser no-ops, leaving cmd_wiki editor and conversion symbols unresolved during full Stage 4 HIR lowering"
    hir_package_sibling_imported_enum_surface_leak_2026_08_02, 0, "Sibling enum rematerialization is fixed; explicit named enum imports still materialize bodies without registering the variants' named payload dependency closure"
    stage4_wildcard_reexport_surface_loss_2026_08_03, 0, "Parser export metadata discarded wildcard re-export source modules, leaving facade enum bodies without their payload dependency surfaces"
    gpu_backend_layer_result_reason_clobber_2026_08_03, 0, Shell-global layer_result argument names overwrote the producer reason before artifact classification.
    stage4_lint_enum_terminal_collision_2026_08_03, 0, Stage 4 HIR materializes same-spelled LintLevel and LintCategory payload dependencies from distinct compiler-lint and easy-fix terminal enum owners.



